1.直径700mm，正三角形布置或格栅式布置，单根桩长约16~19m；
2.水泥搅拌桩每立方土体水泥用量260kg，具体以典型施工结果为准;
3.包含抽芯检测15根。28天无侧限抗压强度不小于1.2MPa。; 1.DCM with diameter of 700mm and arranged in triangle，with single lenpth of 16~19m；
2.Consumption of cement is 260kg/m3, which shall be determined by in situ trial;
3.Including coring and testing of 15 nos。UCS in 28d after completion of DCM shall be ≥1.2MPa.

